 kando-kwin-integration
Description: Kando is a cross-platform pie menu for your desktop
 It offers an unconventional, fast, highly efficient, and fun way of interacting
 with your computer! You can use Kando to launch applications, simulate keyboard
 shortcuts, open files, and much more.
 .
 Kando is designed to be used with mouse, stylus, touch, or controller input.
 However, Kando can also be efficiently controlled with a keyboard.
